   "ruby_action": "keep"
  },
  {
   "id": "da0301:T00078",
   "source_sha256": "1bcd241a05c093a3f82410c96084511455741fae14d5176f9b995c5fef1b0c2b",
   "ko": "태풍"
  },
  {
   "id": "da0301:T00079",
   "source_sha256": "3667d991110bf3e81e226ec91ea0189de48bd03dc22ca469bc73d2aa2993811b",
   "ko": "!?\n　아니면, 아니면……읏!\n　자칭 원리주의자의\n　테러인가요오~~옷!?」"
  },
  {
   "id": "da0301:T00080",
   "source_sha256": "c4d75ceff798128ef9c5f884c158455a1a0b0dfc73a5d5556dc72b6522b6ce0d",
   "ko": "「지지지지진정해라!　진정하는 기라, 소냐!　이럴 때일수록 냉정하게……"
  },
  {
   "id": "da0301:T00081",
   "source_sha256": "12607b4f5bd0dc6b32798c2e2e4d330cde52550948acfe3d1c3f77b12391c53f",
   "ko": " 우오와아아아아아아!?」"
  },
  {
   "id": "da0301:T00082",
   "source_sha256": "847672b270abec874ec59267adfc9e95052da422a425f346c425d142c5680d1c",
   "ko": "「――피 냄새!\n　큭…… 꺄아아아아아!」"
  },
  {
   "id": "da0301:T00083",
   "source_sha256": "d359f5fd944ec89d2d289f9162f73de94b2df2f055d4013a9603f71daf3f85fd",
   "ko": "「무슨 원리주의인지는\n　비밀이에요오오~~~~옷!」"
  },
  {
   "id": "da0301:T00084",
   "source_sha256": "45f7e9c74db9b5d3cf2636d7dce6b755505ccf0477fd1f5ec807c20d3c8efc34",
   "ko": "「라이카 누나!\n　뭔가 이쪽으로 오는데!?」"
  },
  {
   "id": "da0301:T00085",
   "source_sha256": "699698747b65c6baab9dcc04f4dd5e88e84fd64ce39f81c37ded85cc816183b6",
   "ko": "「회, 회오리!?　이중으로 된!?」"
  },
  {
   "id": "da0301:T00086",
   "source_sha256": "58008f612b2a2a829eb11bc7513a516b44a8ede89e710f65df759d1f2c73bb24",
   "ko": "「잠…… 점점 커져서……\n　우, 우와아아아아!?」"
  },
  {
   "id": "da0301:T00087",
   "source_sha256": "a96934fc7d1780653fdf6111b4fd1592048711caa699e802279f7cb2b9fb4e27",
