   "ko": "「……읏!」"
  },
  {
   "id": "da0301:T00108",
   "source_sha256": "2aaf9a53b8d09a6e3df0e1da2c2b5cd76f9efeb561e7271743f0f748cee4e365",
   "ko": "「테케리 리~~~~잇」"
  },
  {
   "id": "da0301:T00109",
